  "install_text": "**SM-W Plug**\n\nSingle-phase energy meter with integrated relay for load control.\n\n**Measured Parameters**\n- Active/Reactive/Apparent Power\n- Voltage (V)\n- Current (A)\n- Power Factor\n- Phase Angle (°)\n- Frequency (Hz)\n- Active Energy Consumption (kWh)\n- Relay State (on/off)\n- Wi-Fi Signal Strength (dBm)\n\nThe device transmits a JSON object with 12 fields. All values are sent as strings.",
